    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert resume reviewer and career coach.\nAnalyze the resume below for a candidate targeting this role: \"{{ $json.jobRole }}\".\n\nRESUME:\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.resumeText }}\n\"\"\"\n\nProduce a detailed, constructive evaluation with these clearly labeled sections:\n1. Overall Impression & Fit Score (0-100) for the target role, with a one-paragraph rationale.\n2. Missing or Weak Sections (e.g. summary, skills, experience, education, contact info) and what to add.\n3. Weak Descriptions & Bullet Points: quote weak lines and rewrite them using strong action verbs and quantified impact.\n4. Grammar, Spelling & Consistency Issues: list specific corrections.\n5. Formatting & Structure Consistency: tense, date formats, capitalization, ordering, length.\n6. Skills & Achievements Showcase: how to better highlight skills and measurable achievements relevant to the target role, including keywords to add for ATS.\n7. Prioritized Action Checklist: the top 5-7 improvements ranked by impact.\n\nBe specific, actionable, and encouraging. Use markdown headings and bullet points.",
        "batching": {}
      },
